WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.835
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.503
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're all doing well.

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:05.872
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:07.740
President Biden traveled today
to New York City.

00:00:07.806 --> 00:00:10.310
So, yeah, those
Times Square Elmos

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:12.311
made some good money.

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:13.479
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:14.948
In his speech yesterday

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:17.216
about the Senate's
bipartisan immigration bill,

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.051
President Biden said
that Republicans

00:00:19.118 --> 00:00:21.520
are unwilling to pass
the legislation

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:23.823
because they're, quote,
"afraid of Donald Trump."

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:27.160
Uhh, he tried to have
his vice president killed.

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:29.395
I would be, too.

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.463
That's like saying
no one's willing to work

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:32.865
at Camp Crystal Lake

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.433
'cause they're all
scared of Jason.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.602
It's a valid concern.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.937
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.003 --> 00:00:39.772
The Biden campaign
is reportedly worried

00:00:39.838 --> 00:00:41.975
that the Justice Department's
final report

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:43.977
about the mishandled
classified documents

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:45.445
found at his home
in Delaware

00:00:45.511 --> 00:00:47.680
might contain
some embarrassing details,

00:00:47.746 --> 00:00:50.016
like how he lives
in Delaware.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.018
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:53.986
Election officials in New York
yesterday

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:55.755
decided to keep
former President Trump

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:58.091
on the state's Republican
presidential primary ballot.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:01:00.560
After all, it's one of
the few things left here

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:02.762
that still has
his name on it.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:05.765
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.831 --> 00:01:08.835
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden
attended a SoulCycle class

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:10.236
over the weekend
in Los Angeles,

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:12.137
and attendees
were reportedly patted down

00:01:12.204 --> 00:01:14.074
by the Secret Service.
Said attendees,

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.510
"Where could I possibly
be hiding anything?"

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.511
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.578 --> 00:01:21.013
In a New York Times op-ed,

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:23.082
former Trump adviser
Kellyanne Conway

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.417
said that she would suggest

00:01:24.483 --> 00:01:26.552
he pick a person of color
to be his running mate.

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.220
I don't know, he managed
to win last time

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:31.190
with a running mate
who was completely colorless.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:32.591
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.658 --> 00:01:34.727
The only reason you can
even see Pence in this picture

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:36.729
is because he's blushing.

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:38.731
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:41.467
Former Fox News host Tucker
Carlson announced yesterday

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:44.270
that he will interview Russian
President Vladimir Putin.

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:46.438
And while they may not
speak the same language,

00:01:46.505 --> 00:01:48.441
they also kinda do.

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:49.642
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:51.511
That's right,
Tucker Carlson plans

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:52.979
to interview Vladimir Putin.

00:01:53.045 --> 00:01:55.280
As for why he chose Putin,
it's pretty simple --

00:01:55.347 --> 00:01:57.282
Hitler's dead.

00:01:57.349 --> 00:02:00.120
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:06.092
And that's how I feel
about that.

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:08.261
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:10.930
Former President Trump last
night called on conservatives

00:02:10.996 --> 00:02:13.232
to end their boycott
of Budweiser brewer

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:15.735
Anheuser-Busch
over its association

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:17.503
with influencer
Dylan Mulvaney

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.939
and said it is, quote,
"A great American brand

00:02:20.005 --> 00:02:22.008
that perhaps deserves
a second chance."

00:02:22.074 --> 00:02:24.243
Because if there's one thing
Trump believes in,

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.712
it's unlimited chances.

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:28.781
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:31.384
Filmmaker Martin Scorsese
is set to premiere

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:34.120
his first Super Bowl commercial
ahead of Sunday's game,

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:35.621
which will push back the kickoff

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:37.456
by more than three hours.

00:02:37.523 --> 00:02:40.159
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.862
ESPN, Fox, and
Warner Bros. Discovery yesterday

00:02:42.928 --> 00:02:44.263
announced a partnership
to launch

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.931
a sports streaming service

00:02:45.998 --> 00:02:47.600
that would bundle
all their offerings

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:48.901
into one package.

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:51.971
This is like when Uber
invented the taxi cab.

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.640
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.310
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.376 --> 00:03:00.980
Kinda how I thought
that joke might go.

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:02.014
So, in a way I'm right,

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:04.116
but in a way bigger way,

00:03:04.183 --> 00:03:05.284
I'm wrong.

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:06.552
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:09.154
Pizza Hut is offering
a so-called goodbye pie,

00:03:09.221 --> 00:03:12.325
which they can have delivered
to their soon-to-be ex.

00:03:12.391 --> 00:03:14.927
I don't know, I feel like that
could go a lot of different ways

00:03:14.993 --> 00:03:16.395
for the delivery guy.

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:17.696
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.763 --> 00:03:19.732
"I didn't get any tips,
but I got punched twice

00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:21.801
and I have a new girlfriend."

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.802
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.869 --> 00:03:26.272
And finally, authorities
in Michigan recently arrested

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:29.642
a woman who allegedly stole
an Amish horse and buggy,

00:03:29.708 --> 00:03:32.444
after she was found
hiding in a motel shower

00:03:32.511 --> 00:03:33.813
under a pile of clothes.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.181
Wow, she really did not like

00:03:36.248 --> 00:03:38.017
getting dumped by pizza.

00:03:38.084 --> 00:03:39.719
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.786 --> 00:03:41.654
That was a monologue, everybody!

